{:frontmatter
 {:id "adr-2607071600-net-babiniku-service-completion-design"
  :title "ADR-2607071600: net-babiniku 完成系 -- service completion design (LP, live
          avatars, murakumo LLM, kisekae editor)"
  :status "proposed"
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "net-babiniku-service-completion"
  :authoritative true
  :last_verified "2026-07-07"
  :authoritative_for
  ["net-babiniku's 完成系 is five capabilities with explicit done-criteria: live chat
    (murakumo), live per-character avatars, character creation (kisekae), visitor-shaped
    LP, and monetization staying honestly HARD-held until the etzhayyim rail matures"
   "the LLM backend targets api.murakumo.cloud/v1/messages (local-murakumo, verified
    self-hosted qwen-agentworld-35b-a3b, no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY anywhere) -- NOT the
    murakumo.cloud Sora proxy, whose upstream is unverifiable and could silently be real
    Anthropic; ADR-2607070800 is superseded in provider/model choice only, its boundary
    design (server-side call, persona prompts, schema-mirrors-governor, honest-default)
    carries forward"
   "per-character avatars port network-isekai's isekai.stage avatar-cache/ensure-avatar!
    pattern; roster gains :vrm-url; only 2 license-clear sample VRMs exist, which is why
    kisekae-produced user avatars are the durable supply"
   "character creation embeds the kisekae flow (ADR-2607071610): spec-as-artifact,
    MemSpecStore first, kotobase-backed persistence as follow-up wiring; created
    characters are the creator-economy supply side of ADR-2607062200's 80/20"
   "the LP re-frames containment transparency as a labeled trust section -- nothing about
    the audit-ledger design is deleted"]
  :related
  ["90-docs/adr/2607071610-kotoba-lang-kisekae-vrm-character-editor.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2607070800-net-babiniku-llm-backend-claude-sonnet-5.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2607071000-net-babiniku-crypto-payment-rail-etzhayyim-consumption.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2607062200-net-babiniku-onlyfans-style-creator-monetization.md"]
